 "title": "Air France 447: what really happened",
 "scenes": [
  {
   "narration": "In 2009, a jet carrying 228 people vanished over the Atlantic. The answer was hiding four kilometres under the sea.",
   "background": {
    "type": "world3d"
   },
   "elements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Air France 447",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.13,
     "size": 0.05,
     "color": "#ffffff",
     "bg": "#c62828",
     "bg_alpha": 0.9,
     "style": "label",
     "stroke": false,
     "enter": "pop",
     "at": 0.2
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "1 June 2009",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.2,
     "size": 0.042,
     "color": "#ffffff",
     "bg": "#14181f",
     "bg_alpha": 0.9,
     "style": "label",
     "stroke": false,
     "enter": "pop",
     "at": 0.2
    }
   ],
   "id": "s1"
  },
  {
   "narration": "Air France 447, Rio to Paris. After midnight it flies into a wall of storms, and the captain goes for his rest break.",
   "background": {
    "type": "world3d"
   },
   "elements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Rio de Janeiro to Paris",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.13,
     "size": 0.042,
     "color": "#ffffff",
     "bg": "#14181f",
     "bg_alpha": 0.9,
     "style": "label",
     "stroke": false,
     "enter": "pop",
     "at": 0.2,
     "until": 4.0
    }
   ],
   "id": "s2"
  },
  {
   "narration": "Ice crystals block the pitot tubes, the probes that measure speed. The readings go haywire, and the autopilot switches off.",
   "background": {
    "type": "world3d"
   },
   "elements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Pitot tubes icing up",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.15,
     "size": 0.05,
     "color": "#ffffff",
     "bg": "#c62828",
     "bg_alpha": 0.9,
     "style": "label",
     "stroke": false,
     "enter": "pop",
     "at_word": "pitot",
     "until": 5.0
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "AUTOPILOT OFF",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.15,
     "size": 0.05,
     "color": "#ffffff",
     "bg": "#c62828",
     "bg_alpha": 0.9,
     "style": "label",
     "stroke": false,
     "enter": "pop",
     "at_word": "autopilot"
    }
   ],
   "id": "s3"
  },
  {
   "narration": "The co-pilot takes manual control and pulls the nose up. The jet climbs, loses speed, and stalls.",
   "background": {
    "type": "world3d"
   },
   "elements": [
    {
     "type": "counter",
     "from": 35000,
     "to": 38000,
     "suffix": " ft",
     "grouping": "western",
     "count_dur": 1.8,
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.23,
     "size": 0.05,
     "color": "#ffd54a",
     "bg": "#14181f",
     "bg_alpha": 0.85,
     "style": "label",
     "stroke": false,
     "enter": "pop",
     "at_word": "climbs,"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "STALL",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.13,
     "size": 0.05,
     "color": "#ffffff",
     "bg": "#c62828",
     "bg_alpha": 0.9,
     "style": "label",
     "stroke": false,
     "enter": "pop",
     "at_word": "stalls."
    }
   ],
   "id": "s4"
  },
  {
   "narration": "The stall alarm blares. But when the plane got too slow, the computer ignored its own data and went quiet. Pushing the nose down, the right move, made the alarm come back.",
   "background": {
    "type": "world3d"
   },
   "elements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "STALL!  STALL!",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.13,
     "size": 0.05,
     "color": "#ffffff",
     "bg": "#c62828",
     "bg_alpha": 0.9,
     "style": "label",
     "stroke": false,
     "enter": "pop",
     "at_word": "blares.",
     "until": 5.6
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Too slow: the alarm goes silent",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.13,
     "size": 0.04,
     "color": "#ffffff",
     "bg": "#14181f",
     "bg_alpha": 0.9,
     "style": "label",
     "stroke": false,
     "enter": "pop",
     "at_word": "quiet.",
     "until": 8.0
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Nose down: the alarm returns",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.13,
     "size": 0.04,
     "color": "#ffffff",
     "bg": "#c62828",
     "bg_alpha": 0.9,
     "style": "label",
     "stroke": false,
     "enter": "pop",
     "at_word": "down,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "s5"
  },
  {
   "narration": "The captain rushes back, but it is too late. For three and a half minutes the jet falls, nose up, and hits the ocean. No one survives.",
